1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
You hear it before you see it. Clicking.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,300
Hundreds of legs on concrete.

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:10,800
Outside your window, an ant as tall as you grabs a car door and pulls…

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,400
and its leg snaps.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:18,600
Grow an ant five hundred times taller, and its body becomes a hundred and twenty-five million times heavier.

6
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,800
Its muscles? Only a quarter-million times stronger.

7
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,900
Its shell starts to crack.

8
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,600
Its body can't pull in enough air.

9
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,400
The invasion collapses right on your doorstep.
